n 5 U.S.C. 5302(1)), as adjusted \nunder 5 U.S.C. 5303 and section 748 of title VII of division D of the \nConsolidated Appropriations Act, 2019 (Public Law 116–6), are set forth \non the schedules attached hereto and made a part hereof:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 1 (lead-in)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The General Schedule (5 U.S.C. 5332(a)) at Schedule 1;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 1(a)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec1(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Foreign Service Schedule (22 U.S.C. 3963) at Schedule 2; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 1(b)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec1(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) The schedules for the Veterans Health Administration of the Department \nof Veterans Affairs (38 U.S.C. 7306, 7404; section 301(a) of Public Law \n102–40) at Schedule 3.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 1(c)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec1(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 2. Senior Executive Service. The ranges of rates of basic pay for senior \nexecutives in the Senior Executive Service, as established pursuant to 5 \nU.S.C. 5382, are set forth on Schedule 4 attached hereto and made a part \nhereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 2","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. Certain Executive, Legislative, and Judicial Salaries. The rates of \nbasic pay or salaries for the following offices and positions are set forth \non the schedules attached hereto and made a part hereof:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 3 (lead-in)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The Executive Schedule (5 U.S.C. 5312–5318) at Schedule 5;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 3(a)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec3(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Vice President (3 U.S.C. 104) and the Congress (2 U.S.C. 4501) \nat Schedule 6; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 3(b)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec3(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) Justices and judges (28 U.S.C. 5, 44(d), 135, 252, and 461(a)) at Schedule \n7.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 3(c)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec3(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. Uniformed Services. The rates of monthly basic pay (37 U.S.C. \n203(a)) for members of the uniformed services, as adjusted under 37 U.S.C. \n1009, and the rate of monthly cadet or midshipman pay (37 U.S.C. 203(c)) \nare set forth on Schedule 8 attached hereto and made a part hereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 4","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) Pursuant to sections 5304 and 5304a of title 5, United States Code, \nand section 748 of title VII of division D of the Consolidated Appropriations \nAct, 2019 (Public Law 116–6), locality-based comparability payments shall \nbe paid in accordance with Schedule 9 attached hereto and made a part \nhereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"84 FR 12853, PDF pages 1-13; Sec. 5(a)","sha256":"89d7ba424f4860e9a7ddc30b6fe94e39a36d4be9e6c2514ffab678dbf20abac9","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2019-04-02/pdf/2019-06548.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13866#sec5(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Director of the Office of Personnel Management shall take such \nactions